### 1. GET All items (Show all)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. GET Item by ID = 1 (Read one)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. POST Create new item (Create one)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "name": "Cure Skin Clarifying Clay Mask",
  "description": "Purifying face mask to absorb excess sebum and clear pores."
}

###

### 4. PUT Update item with ID = 4 (Update one)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "name": "Cure Skin Clarifying Clay Mask (Updated)",
  "description": "Updated purifying face mask description."
}

###

### 5. DELETE Item by ID = 4 (Delete one)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json